                                                "sense_id": "ded7a6fa-4856-34c0-a14d-aab8095467fd",
                                                "text": "The next highest percentages were in Oklahoma, Nevada and New Mexico, with 26.3%, 25.6% and 25.4%, respectively."
                                            },
